1
00:00:00,240 --> 00:00:03,540
The fastest growth periods are often the most miserable.

2
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:06,240
If you want to progress, get used to pain.

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,680
If you think about what actually occurs when you grow,

4
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:11,040
you stretch past your point of comfort.

5
00:00:11,040 --> 00:00:12,240
So even if you're growing a muscle,

6
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:14,600
like you stretch it, you break it down, it's painful.

7
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,820
If you have growing pains, like as a kid,

8
00:00:16,820 --> 00:00:18,240
it's like you grew too fast

9
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,960
and your joints are in a lot of pain.

10
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:22,440
If you're a company and you expand,

11
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:24,160
this is technically supposed to be good stuff,

12
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,960
but it doesn't make it any less painful.

13
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:29,120
Elite athletes don't get stronger during easy workouts.

14
00:00:29,120 --> 00:00:31,320
If we want progress,

15
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:34,900
we must accept the price of pain that's attached to it.

16
00:00:34,900 --> 00:00:37,920
You cannot both want progress and live an easy life.

17
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:39,320
These two things conflict.

